   "subject": "Calculate gain and loss in R?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>assume :</div><div>x=c(2,5,6,1,3,8,4,5,6)<br></div><div>I need to do this</div><div>2-5=-3</div><div>5-6=-1</div><div>6-1=+5</div><div>1-3=-2</div><div>3-8=-5</div><div>8-4=+4</div><div>4-5=-1</div><div>5-6=-1</div><div><br></div><div>gain=5+4=9  (sum up all positive values)</div><div>loss=-3-1-2-5-1-1=-14 (sum up all negative values)</div><div><br></div><div>Any one has any deai how to do this inR</div><div>In thanks in advance,</div><div>Bic</div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
